<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Safety Fest Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-logo { float: left; margin-right: 30px; }
  .content-area { margin-left: 200px; }
  .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  .centered { text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
  </div>
  <div class="content-area">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Pocatello Safety Fest 2022</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 0;">Idaho State University-Rendezvous Building</h2>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Sponsorships and Vendor Opportunities:</h3>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p><strong>Title Sponsor - $5,000</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Listing on Pre-Safety Fest Marketing Materials and Website as Title Sponsor</li>
        <li>Hyperlink to Sponsor's Website from the Pocatello Safety Fest Homepage</li>
        <li>Exhibit Table for Tuesday and Wednesday in Prime Location</li>
        <li>24x36 Poster Space at Registration Table</li>
        <li>On-site Signage and Recognition as Title Sponsor</li>
        <li>Business Name/Logo on the Following Year's Solicitation Letters</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p><strong>Platinum Sponsor - $2,500</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Listing on Pre-Safety Fest Marketing Materials and Website as Platinum Sponsor</li>
        <li>Hyperlink to Sponsor's Website from the Pocatello Safety Fest Homepage</li>
        <li>Exhibit Table for Tuesday and Wednesday in Prime Location</li>
        <li>11x17 Poster Space at Registration Table</li>
        <li>On-site Signage and Recognition as Platinum Sponsor</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p><strong>Gold Sponsor - $1,250</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Listing on Pre-Safety Fest Marketing Materials and Website as Gold Sponsor</li>
        <li>Hyperlink to Sponsor's Website from the Pocatello Safety Fest Homepage</li>
        <li>Exhibit Table for Tuesday and Wednesday in Prime Location</li>
        <li>On-site Signage and Recognition as Gold Sponsor</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p><strong>Break Sponsor - $500</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Exhibit Table for Tuesday and Wednesday</li>
        <li>On-site Signage and Recognition as Break Sponsor</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p><strong>2 Day Vendor - $300 (Oversized Booth Space is an Extra $50)</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Exhibit Table for Tuesday and Wednesday</li>
        <li>Name Listed on Vendor Bingo</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
            </div>
            <div class="signature-block">
                <p>Shirley Hockett</p>
                <p><span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="address.city">{{ address.city }}</span>, <span data-field="address.state">{{ address.state }}</span> <span data-field="address.zip">{{ address.zip }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Remember our classes are FREE and all Safety Fest expenses are paid for by sponsorship and donations from businesses and individuals like you.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="content-area">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Pocatello 2022 Safety Fest Vendor Request Form</h2>
    <p>Event Dates: <span data-field="event_dates">{{ event_dates }}</span></p>
    <p>Please email completed form to: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Please remember there are no sales on site.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Vendor Options: (Please indicate your booth choice)</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Option</th>
          <th>Cost</th>
          <th>Yes ( )</th>
          <th>No ( )</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>2 Day Vendor Booth (Tuesday & Wednesday)</td>
          <td>$250</td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.2_day_booth_yes">{{ vendor_options.2_day_booth_yes }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.2_day_booth_no">{{ vendor_options.2_day_booth_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>2 Day Vendor Booth Oversized (Tuesday & Wednesday) Add-on Option - $50</td>
          <td>$50</td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.oversized_yes">{{ vendor_options.oversized_yes }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.oversized_no">{{ vendor_options.oversized_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Break Sponsor (includes Vendor Booth for Tuesday & Wednesday)</td>
          <td>$500</td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.break_sponsor_yes">{{ vendor_options.break_sponsor_yes }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="vendor_options.break_sponsor_no">{{ vendor_options.break_sponsor_no }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Organization</h3>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Name of Organization:</td>
        <td><span data-field="organization.name">{{ organization.name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Representative Name:</td>
        <td><span data-field="organization.representative_name">{{ organization.representative_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Phone Number:</td>
        <td><span data-field="organization.phone">{{ organization.phone }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Email Address:</td>
        <td><span data-field="organization.email">{{ organization.email }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Address:</td>
        <td><span data-field="organization.address">{{ organization.address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Booth Information</h3>
    <p>Each vendor will have 1 table (8ft) and 2 chairs included. Set up will be Monday, May 9th from 3-5 p.m.</p>
    <p>Will you need electricity for your area? Yes ( ) No ( ) Booths with electricity are limited.</p>
    <p>Will you need more than the 2 hours for set up? Yes ( ) No ( )</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Names for Badges</h3>
    <p>List first and last names of those at your booth:</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for list -->
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Vendor Bingo</h3>
    <p>Your company will automatically be listed on the bingo cards if you are registered as a vendor before April 29th. After that date cards will already be printed for the event.</p>
    <p>We encourage you to donate prizes for the bingo drawing.</p>
    <p>Please list prize(s) you are donating:</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for list -->
    </div>

    <p>*Drawing will be held Wednesday afternoon.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px;">Sponsorship Inquiry</h3>
    <p>Are you interested in sponsoring a grand prize drawing? Yes ( ) No ( )</p>
    <p>Contact us about additional advertising as a grand prize drawing sponsor.</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <!-- Placeholder for additional requests -->
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Vendor booth payments made by check must be made payable to <span data-field="payment_recipient">{{ payment_recipient }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="payment_address">{{ payment_address }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>